  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c982cddb9d3d73568c8e8db779f016b4f1384d30a5032236c60322b46c22b486.png] \n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\n⇒** First Number × (First Number)²** **+ 2 = Second Number.**\n\nLet's check as per the logic,\n\n**1) 14 - 2762**\n\n→ 14 × (14)² + 2 = 2762\n\n→ 14 × 196 + 2 = 2762\n\n→ 2744 + 2 = 2762\n\n→ 2746 ≠ 2762\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**2) 16 - 4098**\n\n→ 16 × (16)2 + 2 = 4098\n\n→ 16 × 256 + 2 = 4098\n\n→ 4096 + 2 = 4098\n\n→ 4098 = 4098\n\n→** LHS = RHS.**\n\n**3) 11 - 1333**\n\n→ 11 × (11)2 + 2 = 1333\n\n→ 11 × 121 + 2 = 1333\n\n→ 1331 + 2 = 1333 \n\n→ 1333 = 1333\n\n→ **LHS = RHS.**\n\n**4) 13 - 2199**\n\n→ 13 × (13)2 + 2 = 2199\n\n→ 13 × 169 + 2 = 2199\n\n→ 2197 + 2 = 2199\n\n→ 2199 = 2199\n\n→ **LHS = RHS.**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 doesn't follow the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\" 14 - 2762 \"**.",
